      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] Since `fingerprint_auth_enabled()` does not depend on `params`, `size`, `xfer_complete`, `offset`, or `idx`, consider moving this check to the very beginning of `fp_command_template_v0` before casting and reading `args-\u003einput_buf` and `global_context.templ_valid`:\n\n```cpp\nstatic enum ec_host_cmd_status\nfp_command_template_v0(struct ec_host_cmd_handler_args *args)\n{\n\t/*\n\t * When fingerprint auth is enabled, legacy unauthenticated (un-MAC\u0027ed)\n\t * template modification paths must be disabled. Reject v0 requests\n\t * to prevent arbitrary template injection; high-security contexts\n\t * must route through the v1 secure channel.\n\t */\n\tif (fingerprint_auth_enabled())\n\t\treturn EC_HOST_CMD_ACCESS_DENIED;\n\n\tconst auto *params \u003d static_cast\u003cconst struct ec_params_fp_template *\u003e(\n\t\targs-\u003einput_buf);\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/70b3cb3a-2f47-46d5-b38c-58b2bab865b1)",
